FFmpeg
------
Rigel bundles FFmpeg libraries (libavformat, libavcodec, libavutil,
libswresample, libswscale) built for iOS from the official FFmpeg source.
FFmpeg is not covered by Rigel's Apache-2.0 license.

License: GNU Lesser General Public License version 3 (LGPL-3.0), or any later
version. The build is LGPL-only: it does not enable --enable-gpl or
--enable-nonfree. FFmpeg source code is available at https://ffmpeg.org/ .
The exact build configuration is in scripts/build-ffmpeg.sh.

The FFmpeg libraries are currently linked statically into the Rigel app
binary. In accordance with LGPL-3.0, you may replace them with your own
modified build: the complete corresponding source, the build script and the
Rigel object files needed to relink are available from the project
maintainers on request.
